    {"name": "Checker's own tests pass", "input": "node scripts/capstone/verify-system.test.mjs", "expected": "34/34 passed, exit 0 (missing contract, name mismatch, missing or non-preloadable skill, Agent in a specialist, orchestrator list missing sre, orchestrator with Bash, bad settings JSON, missing hook script, PreCommit event, missing common_site_config deny, allow rule for console, missing tool-guard, gate without Agent(developer), url without type, missing stdio script, qa-bot in a workflow, unknown skill, unresolved @import, skill script outside the sre guard (real tool-guard), allowed-tools WARN, missing modules.txt, app_name mismatch, hooks.py path to a missing def, modules.txt without a package, patch without module or execute, DocType without test or with the wrong class, invalid example handoff, fake bench PASS and WARN, fake bench without spice_lite, apps.txt without spice_lite, usage errors, two runs on this repo)"},
